@fleetops_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### ============================================
### AUTH WITH REFRESH TOKEN
### ============================================

### 1. LOGIN - Dapatkan Access Token dan Refresh Token
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wkwk@gmail.com",
  "password": "wkwkwkwk"
}

### Response akan berisi:
### {
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "refreshToken": "base64string...",
###   "expiresIn": 900,  // dalam detik (15 menit)
###   "user": {
###     "id": 1,
###     "fullName": "Fit",
###     "email": "wkwk@gmail.com",
###     "roleName": "Driver"
###   }
### }

### 2. REGISTER - Register User Baru
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. REFRESH TOKEN - Dapatkan Access Token Baru
### Gunakan refresh token dari login response
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste_refresh_token_here"
}

### Response:
### {
###   "accessToken": "new_access_token",
###   "refreshToken": "new_refresh_token",
###   "expiresIn": 900
### }

### 4. LOGOUT - Revoke Satu Refresh Token
### Perlu Authorization header dengan access token
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{
  "refreshToken": "paste_refresh_token_here"
}

### 5. LOGOUT ALL DEVICES - Logout dari Semua Device
### Revoke semua refresh token milik user
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{}

### ============================================
### FLOW PENGGUNAAN DI FRONTEND
### ============================================
###
### 1. User login:
###    POST /api/auth/login
###    → Simpan accessToken di memory/state (jangan localStorage untuk security)
###    → Simpan refreshToken di httpOnly cookie atau secure storage
###
### 2. Setiap request API:
###    Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
###
### 3. Jika dapat 401 Unauthorized:
###    → Gunakan refreshToken untuk get access token baru
###    → POST /api/auth/refresh dengan refreshToken
###    → Update accessToken
###    → Retry request awal
###
### 4. Saat user logout:
###    → POST /api/auth/logout dengan refreshToken
###    → Hapus accessToken dari memory
###    → Hapus refreshToken dari storage
###    → Redirect ke login page
###
### 5. Logout dari semua device:
###    → POST /api/auth/logout-all (dengan auth header)
###    → Revoke semua refresh tokens
###    → Logout dari semua device
